# The root is a shortcut to the Chinese site, as a real HTTP redirect. The
# exported index.html can only do a meta refresh, which still loads the page and
# its scripts before navigating again, and browsers never cache it — every visit
# paid two round trips. A 301 is served before any asset and is cached by the
# browser, so repeat visits go straight to /zh.
#
# Keep the meta refresh in app/(root)/page.tsx: this file only exists on
# Cloudflare Pages, and `next dev` or another static host still needs a way out
# of /.
/ /zh 301
